00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:58.251
-Didn't I buy dinner last time?
-Yes, you did, you did.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:01:59.786
(AUDIENCE LAUGH)

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:01.287
Yeah. And the restaurant
was pretty good.

00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:02.355
That... That does not count.

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:03.489
You did off... you offered

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:04.924
to marry my wife
if I died early.

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:07.527
-Absolutely.
-But I do think this country

00:02:07.593 --> 00:02:10.196
could benefit
from a reparations package

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:12.064
